{"product_id":"finding-perfect-colleen-hoover","title":"Finding Perfect","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFriends Daniel, Six, Holder, Sky, and Breckin are planning to celebrate the upcoming Thanksgiving holiday with a Friendsgiving dinner at Sky's parents' house.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBut things have been off within the tightknit group and when Daniel reaches out to Six to ask the hard questions he hasn't dared to bring up since they last spoke about their shared secret, he's dismayed to learn that it's this very secret bringing a cloud over the holiday. Suddenly, Daniel must do everything he can to find answers for the one person he loves the most in the world, but will this search only lead to despair.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e Author: Colleen Hoover\u003cbr\u003e ISBN: 9781398521179\u003cbr\u003e Format: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e Pages: 83\u003cbr\u003e Dimensions: 26 x 179\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43613408788633,"sku":"10RC9781482380194","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/findingperfect.jpg?v=1700635125","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/finding-perfect-colleen-hoover","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}